#: ../../development.rst:33 a35303579a8d43429df90ac817df1191
msgid "Airtable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:35 8f468bf4eb81471fa0b4eddf4f9c235b
msgid ""
"``AIRTABLE_BASE_ID`` in ``.env`` selects the base: production, or the dev"
" base copied from it (the one ``scripts/reset_dev_store`` is allowed to "
"touch, paired with the ``RewakeDev`` Shopify store below). Get a personal"
" access token with read/write access to that base (plus "
"``schema.bases:read``), then verify it:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:46 87020007ae06430cb3e85f94171d8e5d
msgid ""
"``uv run pytest`` genuinely calls Airtable for a few older tests "
"(``tests/test_auth.py``, ``tests/test_airtable.py``, "
"``tests/test_contact_*.py``) -- they have no mock/fixture layer yet (the "
"newer catalog, script and AI tests use in-memory fakes). That's exactly "
"why tests don't run in CI (see :doc:`operations`): they need six working "
"token/credential secrets (``ADMIN_TOKEN``, ``HELLOPRO_TOKEN``, "
"``MACHINIO_TOKEN``, ``APP_TOKEN``, ``AIRTABLE_TOKEN``, "
"``AIRTABLE_BASE_ID``) just to pass, and a scope/typo issue in any one of "
"them produces a wall of unrelated-looking 500s rather than a clear "
"failure -- more fragile than valuable as a required gate today. Run them "
"locally with a real ``.env`` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:58 f85add64b5114627b73f8d44a49a5ac5
msgid "Shopify (dev store)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:60 d9a05a08b6834e5196c22cee2300b656
msgid ""
"The Shopify scripts (``shopify_catalog_reconciliation``, "
"``create_product_shopify``, ``update_product`` -- see :doc:`scripts`) and"
" the ``scripts/shopify`` tools call Shopify via ``SHOPIFY_SHOP_DOMAIN``/ "
"``SHOPIFY_CLIENT_ID``/``SHOPIFY_CLIENT_SECRET``/``SHOPIFY_API_VERSION`` "
"in ``.env.example`` (required scopes: ``read_products``, "
"``write_products``, ``write_inventory``, ``read_files``, "
"``write_files``). Test it against the **RewakeDev** Shopify development "
"store, never production (``rewake-2``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:68 9de2cd78ea26486ca44003467160c0ab
msgid ""
"There is no access token to configure: Shopify's client-credentials "
"tokens live ~24h (a lifetime Shopify fixes), so "
"``api/integrations/shopify_auth.py`` exchanges the client ID/secret at "
"runtime, caches the token in Redis for the API and every worker, renews "
"it 10 minutes before expiry, and on a 401 renews it and retries once. The"
" client ID/secret themselves don't expire. To verify the credentials and "
"the granted scopes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../development.rst:79 b5574d017f3746d4912f2c53f1b549d8
msgid ""
"Client credentials only work for a store in the Dev Dashboard app's own "
"organization. A new scope only reaches the token after the app version "
"declaring it is released and the update approved on the store. To start "
"the dev store over, ``make reset-dev-store`` empties it (and the dev "
"base's ``Annonces Shopify``) behind a hardcoded guard that refuses any "
"other store/base; ``create_product_shopify`` then recreates the listings."
" Point this project's ``.env`` at that store when testing anything "
"Shopify-related here."
msgstr ""

